# Project board status on every PR

Follow `.cursor/skills/project-status/SKILL.md`.

`.githooks/pre-push` runs `.github/scripts/sync-project-status.sh` for every developer (local `gh`). Add the issue to the project if it is missing, assign it to the PR author, and set Status: Draft → En cours, open `Closes #N` → En revue, merged → Terminé. `Related to #N` stays En cours. Do not leave completed work in Backlog.

